  "changes": [
    "Independent HostStorage retains only real common StorageOwner or typed host resource and stable empty Backend identity. Apple shared Metal and Vulkan staging preserve original native resource ownership; no Model or Backend State is retained.",
    "StateTransfer selects original common/Apple/Vulkan Program/Invocation/Update. Apple original observation lock covers retirement source lookup and attachment. No duplicate executor or common Queue shell.",
    "ScopeAllocator preserves the actual allocator owner until allocate_shared control-block deallocation. Preparation failure recovers every successfully bound original writer; successful wait and real retirement precede complete writer recovery.",
    "Two native CopyStreamAccess declaration headers moved to installed route-owned detail headers; all old includes updated, no shim or native implementation/symbol change. Configure-only component ownership check passed.",
    "Full HostImage test accepts all four compiled backends. Fix Clang dependent-template syntax, complete aggregate initializers, and bounded locale-independent NF4 decimal parsing at existing macOS14.4 deployment floor.",
    "Fix test-only Apple/Vulkan output labels after measured runs. Raw reports and their incorrect cpu labels remain unchanged; actual native argv/loader and source snapshots are retained. No new run for display-only edit."
